<title>UK: German inland gasoil firmer but demand thin.</title>
<headline>German inland gasoil firmer but demand thin.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6971)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     34.20/34.70     20.15/20.44   33.90/34.30</p>
<p> BREMEN		34.20/34.70     20.15/20.44   33.90/34.30</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    34.20/34.70     20.15/20.44   33.80/34.20</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   34.50/35.00     20.32/20.61   34.50/35.00</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   34.50/35.00     20.32/20.61   34.50/35.00</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  35.60/36.00     20.97/21.20   35.50/36.00</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were stable to around 50 pfennigs firmer in line with firmer Rotterdam barge and on the effects of a weakening dollar. But traders said demand was fairly thin due to milder weather conditions. London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
</text>
